      "parameters": {
        "content": {
          "config": {
            "name": "About this demo",
            "parameters": {
              "content": "## Lead Qualifier Agent — LOOM-READY\n\n**Apollo & Clearbit** are real HTTP Request nodes pointing at their actual API URLs. Without a paid key they fail silently (`neverError: true`) and the Normalize nodes substitute realistic demo data so the run never breaks.\n\n**Slack / Gmail / HubSpot** are real nodes — plug in the credentials before filming:\n- Slack: `Slack OAuth2` (free workspace → create app → install to workspace)\n- Gmail: `Gmail OAuth2` (personal Google account)\n- HubSpot: `HubSpot App Token` (free CRM → Private App token)\n- Gemini: free API key from https://aistudio.google.com/\n\n**HubSpot custom properties to create before recording** (Settings → Properties → Create):\n- `lead_score` (number)\n- `icp_tier` (single-line text or dropdown: hot/warm/cold)\n- `scoring_reason` (multi-line text)\n\nPOST test payload to `/webhook/lead-intake`:\n`{\"email\":\"sarah.chen@northwind.io\",\"firstName\":\"Sarah\",\"lastName\":\"Chen\",\"company\":\"Northwind Logistics\",\"jobTitle\":\"VP of Operations\",\"phone\":\"+1-415-555-0180\",\"message\":\"Looking to automate our carrier onboarding flow.\",\"source\":\"website-contact-form\"}`",
              "height": 320,
              "width": 460,
              "color": 5
            },
            "position": [
              180,
              40
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "16baf160-2b59-41ff-93de-1121afa0f626",
