    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are scoring an inbound lead for a B2B SaaS company that sells logistics automation to mid-market logistics and supply-chain companies (100-1000 employees, ops leadership buyer).\n\n## Form submission\nEmail: {{ $(\"Inbound Form\").item.json.body.email }}\nName: {{ $(\"Inbound Form\").item.json.body.firstName }} {{ $(\"Inbound Form\").item.json.body.lastName }}\nJob title: {{ $(\"Inbound Form\").item.json.body.jobTitle }}\nCompany (claimed): {{ $(\"Inbound Form\").item.json.body.company }}\nMessage: {{ $(\"Inbound Form\").item.json.body.message }}\nSource: {{ $(\"Inbound Form\").item.json.body.source }}\n\n## Person enrichment (Apollo)\n{{ JSON.stringify($(\"Person Enrichment\").item.json) }}\n\n## Company enrichment (Clearbit)\n{{ JSON.stringify($(\"Company Enrichment\").item.json) }}\n\n## Scoring rubric (0-100)\n- Title/seniority fit (VP/Director/Head of Ops): up to 30\n- Industry fit (logistics, supply chain, 3PL, freight): up to 25\n- Company size fit (100-1000 employees): up to 20\n- Intent signal in message (carrier, onboarding, automation, efficiency): up to 15\n- Tech stack fit (uses Salesforce/HubSpot/Snowflake): up to 10\n\nTier mapping: 75+ hot, 45-74 warm, <45 cold. Be strict.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a precise B2B lead scoring agent. Always return valid JSON matching the schema. Be conservative - only give 75+ when multiple strong signals align."
        }
      },
